## Next development gate

Phases 1–4 are Owner-accepted; Phase 4 acceptance and explicit deferrals are Owner-reported (ADR-024). P5-002 is authorized within the replacement ticket; implement/validate then stop for independent reviewer, CEO review and Owner Phase 5 acceptance. Preserve prior records, uncommitted deliveries and dist. Phase 6 is NOT AUTHORIZED.

## Record maintenance

Update this summary from explicit Owner decisions and verified evidence. Preserve original historical documents and distinguish requirements, reported history, observed code, executed tests and Owner acceptance. No push, release, deployment or browser-data reset is implied.


